# Flok memory

Memory plugins already exist. Use them; do not invent a new memory skill.

## Layers

| Layer | Tool | When |
|-------|------|------|
| Session graph | ECC memory MCP `search_nodes` / `open_nodes` | Session start / resume Flok work |
| Durable decisions | `create_entities` / `add_observations` | After BUILD ID done, audits, deploy notes |
| Cross-project notes | `user-agent-lab-vault` | Lab session close / long-lived ops |
| Ops workflows | skill `knowledge-ops` | User says save / sync / what do we know |

## Seed entities (expected)

- `Flok` — product + stack
- `BUILD_next` — current next ID (see `BUILD.md`; often S1)
- `GrokHarnessDebt` — OG meta overwrite, preview secret, `/__grok` chrome

## Never store

Secrets: `FLOK_TOKEN_SECRET`, OAuth client secrets, `.env` values, bot tokens, API keys.
